{"4027400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anthracite", "steam_appid": 4027400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027400/extras/149ab02387bd2c11d3d6a73ef743ac30.poster.avif?t=1785110969\" width=1170 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027400/extras/149ab02387bd2c11d3d6a73ef743ac30.webm?t=1785110969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Anthracite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by Studio Ransom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anthracite</strong> is a <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>co-op survival horror</strong> game set in <strong>procedurally and static maps</strong>, where each run is unpredictable and every return  feels earned. Manage your gear, your nerves, and your team or get swallowed by the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027400/extras/2ae01a20cd99acec20bb84b021711183.poster.avif?t=1785110969\" width=1170 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027400/extras/2ae01a20cd99acec20bb84b021711183.webm?t=1785110969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Co-Op Survival Horror</strong><br>Descend with up to 16 players. Coordinate light, sound, and tools to survive the shifting depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Hundreds of Items &amp; Upgrades</strong><br>Scavenge relics, tools, and cursed artifacts from the depths. Every item can help you survive… or doom you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌑 <strong>Round-Based Expeditions</strong><br>Each mission begins on the surface. Plan your loadout, dive deep, and make it back alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>A World Full of Oddities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anthracite blends survival horror with strange humor, cursed lore, fake catalogs, bizarre equipment, and unsettling discoveries hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Built in Godot 4</strong><br>Harnessing the open-source power of <strong>Godot Engine 4</strong>, Anthracite blends hand-crafted art direction with procedural technology for seamless atmospheric realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Every Expedition Leaves a Mark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter strange places.<br>Find what should have stayed lost.<br>Extract before the dark adapts.<br>Survive long enough to come back changed.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027400/extras/149ab02387bd2c11d3d6a73ef743ac30.poster.avif?t=1785110969\" width=1170 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027400/extras/149ab02387bd2c11d3d6a73ef743ac30.webm?t=1785110969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Anthracite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by Studio Ransom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anthracite</strong> is a <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>co-op survival horror</strong> game set in <strong>procedurally and static maps</strong>, where each run is unpredictable and every return  feels earned. Manage your gear, your nerves, and your team or get swallowed by the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 